        "content": "<p>pchickey edited <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14818\">PR #14818</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>wasi-http: Guests can add conflicting content lengths to messages<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-r8xh-cgf7-392j\">GHSA-r8xh-cgf7-392j</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Cranelift backend on aarch64 can jump to incorrect target on large Wasm <code>br_table</code> instruction<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-mghf-wjfp-p5xm\">GHSA-mghf-wjfp-p5xm</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Bit-packing in Cranelift compiler causes silent overflow and miscompilation<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-897f-g5gm-fmxm\">GHSA-897f-g5gm-fmxm</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
